228_westwood-elevation-134220264.jpeg \"Dimple Westwood\")\n\n# Dimple Westwood in Kandivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Dimple Westwood](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/68838/1657276228_westwood-elevation-134220264.jpeg \"Dimple Westwood\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 275 sqft - 710 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 310 Units & 1 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.49 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2027\n* Rera: P51800034338\n\n## About\n\nDimple Westwood is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Kandivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 0.49 Acres, the project features 310 Units in 1 Towers, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 275 sqft to 710 sqft. The address for the project is off m.g.road, kandivali west, western suburbs, mumbai.\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Dimple Westwood are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 275 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 710 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Dimple Westwood are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 71.91 Lakhs and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 1.86 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Dimples Group, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800034338 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2027-12-23, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nDimple Westwood is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 0.49 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 310 Units, 1 Towers\n* Sizes: 275 sqft to 710 sqft\n* Project Address: off m.g.road, kandivali west, western suburbs, mumbai\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Dimples Group\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800034338 Units\n* Possession Start: 2027-12-23\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nDimple Westwood benefits from its location in Kandivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Dimple Westwood will begin in 2027-12-23, and the project is RERA registered under P51800034338 Units. Developed by Dimples Group, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of Dimple Westwood\n\n![Dimple Westwood Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/68838/1657276092_1bhk.png \"Dimple Westwood Floor Plan 275 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (275 Sq. Ft.)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Dimple Westwood Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/68838/1