n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Kandivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai)\n5. Dimples Westwood\n\n[![Dimples Westwood Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/8jEDQRKm8Or2us0X9EWghCOZIK6cVg00ibEHBVuh.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Dimples Westwood\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n0.98 Acres\n\n23 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nDecember 2027\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n**Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Kandivali West Project Key Features:**  \n\n* The project offers 1BHK, 2BHK and 3BHK flats in Kandivali West for sale.\n\n* The project is spread over 0.98 acres of land parcel.\n\n* There will be One towers with modern exterior design\n\n* The elevation of project consists of G+23 residential floors\n\n  \n**How Is The Connectivity Of The Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Property In Kandivali West**?  \n The project offers easy connectivity to Western Express Highway, Kandivali West Railway Station, Metro Station, Thakur Complex Etc.  \n  \n**What Is The Address Of The Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Project?**  \n The Dimple Group Dimples Westwood is located on DP Rd, off Shri Sevantilal Khandwala Marg, opposite Lalji Pada Police Chowki, Ganesh Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.  \n  \n**What Are The Carpet Areas Available At The Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Kandivali West Project?**  \n Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Developers' project offers 1BHK, 2BHK and 3BHK flats in Kandivali West for sale with a carpet area of:  \n\n* 1BHK–– 378--447 sqft\n* 2BHK–- 564—643 SqFt.\n* 3BHK–- 959 SqFt.\n\n  \n  \n**What Is the Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Project Status?**  \n The Dimple Group Developers Dimples Westwood Kandivali West project is under construction.    \n  \n**What Amenities Are Available At Dimple Group Dimples Westwood?**  \n Dimple Group Developers offers 10+ lifestyle amenities, such as a gymnasium, indoor games, kids play Area, Jogging Track and more.  \n  \n**Is Parking Available At Dimple Group Dimples Westwood?**  \n Yes, you will get parking at the Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Project in Kandivali West.  \n  \n**What Is The Rera Number Of Dimple Group Dimples Westwood?**  \n Dimple Group New Launch Dimples Westwood Rera number is P51800034338  \n  \n**What Is The Possession Timeline Of Dimple Group Dimples Westwood?**  \n The Rera Possession of Dimple Group Dimples Westwood is December 2027.  \n  \n**Why Invest In Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Kandivali West Property?**  \n\n* Well-established Location\n* Upgraded Lifestyle\n* Good Safety & Security\n* Easy Access to Basic Facilities\n\n  \n To get the reviews of Dimple Group Builders and Developers, or to schedule a visit to the Dimple Group Dimples Westwood Kandivali West Project sample flat, call us today!\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nDimples Westwood brochure\n\n## Pricing of Dimples Westwood\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [1 BHK Apartment](#tabs-3)\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [378 sqft](#tabs-22052)\n* [386 sqft](#tabs-22053)\n* [434 sqft](#tabs-22054)\n* [447 sqft](#tabs-22055)\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 378 sqft | Price:  ₹ 1.06 Cr\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](h