ommerce\n\n**Hospitals in Kandivali West**\n\n* Thunga Hospital\n* ACE Heart Hospital\n* CritiCare Asia Multispeciality Hospital\n* Cloudnine Hospital - Malad | Best Maternity & Pregnancy Centre\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Kandivali West**\n\n* Infiniti Mall - Malad West\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Inorbit Mall Malad\n* D Mart\n\n## About Dimple Group\n\n![Dimple Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/UoPm27h97Itbor3635bwW3JtB2POzvZd1d9kkhYQ.png)\n\n* Year Estd. 1998\n* [Projects - 6](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/dimple-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Dimple Group\n\nFor over 28 years, Dimples Group has served as a trusted symbol of quality across Mumbai, delivering more than 22 supreme-quality projects to a thriving family of over 5,\n\nread more\n\n000 happy homeowners. The group operates on a heartfelt mission to turn their customers' dreams of world-class living into a smooth reality through architectural innovation, timely delivery, and transparent practices. By offering diverse housing options tailored to each unique customer segment, Dimples Group ensures that high-quality construction and state-of-the-art planning remain accessible, making the entire homebuying process a welcoming, stress-free, and thoroughly rewarding milestone for families.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of Dimples Westwood\n\n![P51800034338.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/FgRIzkCJsrUqGmdgaadBIyrHsglYo4XZsrq8SJAJ.webp) P51800034338\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Dimples Westwood\n\nWhat is the address of Dimples Westwood?\n\nThe Dimples Westwood is located at Kandivali West, Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Dimples Westwood?\n\nDimples Westwood Kandivali West RERA number is P51800034338.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Dimples Westwood Kandivali West?\n\nDimples Westwood offers premium 1,2