# Dimples Westwood\n\n![pointer](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pointerProjectInfo.svg)\n![Dimples Group logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9fb08386bae1540186bb70abfb6b12/logo/8a9fb08386bae1540186bb70abfb6b12_logo_YKOzxCIlGi1752673635013.jpg)\n\n## By Dimples Group\n\n![formard](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/ArrowForwardBlack_nbReact_453525.svg)\n![house](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/houseProjectInfo.svg)\n![drop](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/dropProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![frame](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/frameProjectInfo.svg)\n![claim](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-merchandise%2FclaimbenefitsIcon_nbReact221sor.webp&w=3840&q=75)\n![right](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowProjectInfo.svg)\n![download](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/downloadProjectInfo.svg)\n\n## Key Features\n\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n\n## Dimples Westwood Floor Plans\n\n## Amenities in Dimples Westwood\n\n![show more](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/greenDropDownIcn.svg)\n\n## About the Dimples Westwood\n\n**Dimples Westwood offers contemporary housing in the heart of Mumbai, Maharashtra. With one tower rising 23 storeys and featuring 350 units, the layouts ensure ample space, optimal ventilation, and premium fittings. The project offers 1 BHK (378–447 sq. ft. carpet area) and 2 BHK (604–643 sq. ft. carpet area) homes, with Dimples Westwood price ranges from Rs. 85.09 Lakhs to Rs. 1.54 Crore. Key amenities include a fully equipped gym, a yoga and meditation deck, a kids’ play area, and a rooftop lounge. Located near Croma, Infinity Mall, Inorbit Mall, and Arya Women’s Hospital, the project offers excellent connectivity and daily convenience.**\n\n## **Dimples Westwood Overview**\n\n**Land area & units: 2.10 Acres | 1 Tower | 350 Units**\n\n**Storeys: 23 Storeys**\n\n**Landmark & Nearby Hub: Croma**\n\n**Possession Date: December 2027**\n\n**RERA: P51800034338**\n\n**Address: WestWood, DP Rd, Off Shri Sevantilal Khandwala Marg, Opposite Lalji Pada Police Chowki, Ganesh Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067**\n\n**Google Map: [Dimples Westwood Location](https://www.google.com/maps/place/WestWood+-+Residential+Real+Estate+Project+in+Mumbai/@19.2033554,72.8322865,18z/data=!4m16!1m8!2m7!1s+Dimples+Westwood+apartment!3m5!2sWestwood+Dimple+Group,+New+Link+Rd,+near+Dhanukarwadi+metro+station,+Kandivali,+Mahatma+Gandhi+Nagar,+Kandivali+West,+Mumbai,+Maharashtra+400067!3s0x3be7b76c51336949:0x612a304ba942e787!4m2!1d72.8337194!2d19.2033143!3m6!1s0x3be7b7fb6ecfd58f:0x5679c60af25a05c0!8m2!3d19.2033554!4d72.8333808!15sChpEaW1wbGVzIFdlc3R3b29kIGFwYXJ0bWVudFocIhpkaW1wbGVzIHdlc3R3b29kIGFwYXJ0bWVudJIBEmFwYXJ0bWVudF9idWlsZGluZ5oBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSTWNqbDFiR2hCUlJBQqoBYhABKh4iGmRpbXBsZXMgd2VzdHdvb2QgYXBhcnRtZW50KAAyHhABIhoYs-3EwH6AzuKm7E57vQpiRlI1TOUz3QltZjIeEAIiGmRpbXBsZXMgd2VzdHdvb2QgYXBhcnRtZW504AEA-gEECAAQFg!16s%2Fg%2F11w4374z2h?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDgyNS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D)**\n\n## **Configurations & Price Ranges**\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Configuration | Carpet Area | Price |\n| 1 BHK | 378 sq. ft. - 447 sq. ft. | Rs. 1.08 Crore Onwards |\n| 2 BHK | 604 sq. ft. - 643 sq. ft. | Rs. 1.65 Crore Onwards |\n\nConfiguration\n\nCarpet Area\n\nPrice\n\n1 BHK\n\n378 sq. ft. - 447 sq. ft.\n\nRs. 1.08 Crore Onwards\n\n2 BHK\n\n604 sq. ft. - 643 sq. ft.\n\nRs. 1.65 Crore Onwards\n\n## **Why invest?**\n\n**Prime Location Advantage: Dimples Westwood location in Kandivali West, Mumbai, ensures excellent connectivity to schools, colleges, hospitals, and shopping hubs like Infinity Mall and Inorbit Mall.**\n\n**Modern Lifestyle Amenities: Dimples Westwood amenities include a fully equipped gym, yoga deck, kids’ play area, and rooftop retreats, catering to every age group.**\n\n**Future Value Appreciation: Kandivali West is witnessing steady growth, and the Dimples Westwood price trend indicates strong potential for long-term returns, making it an ideal investment choice.**\n\n## **Amenities Offered at Dimples Westwood**\n\n**At Dimples Westwood, every amenity is thoughtfully designed to bring balance, relaxation, and energy to your everyday life. From fitness to family time, each space adds a touch of comfort and joy.**\n\n### **Wellness & Fitness Zone**\n\n**Fully Equipped Gymnasium**\n\n**Jogging Track**\n\n**Yoga and Meditation Deck**\n\n### **Family & Fun Corners**\n\n**Kids' Play Area**\n\n**Senior Citizen Zone**\n\n### **Skyline Retreats**\n\n**Rooftop Lounge**\n\n**Rooftop Garden**\n\n## **Location and Connectivity**\n\n**Dimples Westwood is located in[Kandivali West](https://www.nobroker.in/new-projects-in-kandivali-west-mumbai), Mumbai.**\n\n**Kandivali West is a locality in the northern part of Mumbai. This prime location is well-connected to key parts of the city, making it a sought-after destination for homebuyers and investors.**\n\n**Thakur International School- 1.3 km**\n\n**Atharva College- 1.4 km**\n\n**Don Bosco School- 3.4 km**\n\n**Cambridge School- 5.9 km**\n\n**Thakur College- 6.1 km**\n\n**Arya Women's Hospital- 550 m**\n\n**Oscar Hospital- 600 m**\n\n**Phoenix Hospital- 750 m**\n\n**Aastha Hospital- 2.7 km**\n\n**Infinity Mall- 2.4 km**\n\n**Inorbit Mall- 3.5 km**\n\n## **Construction & Delivery Timeline**\n\n**Dimples Westwood is under construction, with an expected possession date of December 2027.**\n\n## **Summary**\n\n**Dimples Westwood in Kandivali West, Mumbai, blends modern living with excellent connectivity, offering 1 & 2 BHK homes designed for comfort and convenience. Its thoughtful amenities and prime location make it an appealing residential choice.**\n\n### **Pros**\n\n**Compact yet efficient layouts with good ventilation and fittings.**\n\n**Rooftop garden and lounge provide premium leisure spaces rarely found in this segment.**\n\n**Senior citizen zone and kids’ play area cater to all age groups in the family.**\n\n**Situated close to daily conveniences like Croma and local markets.**\n\n### **Cons**\n\n**Limited configuration options (only 1 & 2 BHK available).**\n\n**The 2027 possession timeline may not suit buyers seeking immediate housing.**\n\n## Dimples Westwood - RERA & Legal Certificates\n\n![view](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Eye.svg)\n\nThe Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 is Act of the Parliament of India which seeks to protect buyers as well as help boost investments in the real estate industry. The Act came into force from 1 May 2016.\n\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![approved](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rera_approved_seal.png)\n![Timely Dispute Resolution](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Question.svg)\n![Quality Assurance](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/SealCheck.svg)\n![Buyer Protection](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ShieldCheck.svg)\n![Transparency & Tracking](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/FileMagnifyingGlass.svg)\n\n## Dimples Westwood - Neighbourhood\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/CTAbg.webp)\n\n### Looking for your dream home?\n\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/house.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/lightbulb-filament.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ListChecks.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowWhite.svg)\n\n## Compare Projects\n\n## Price Trend for Dimples Westwood\n\n![connect_img](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/connectPropertyImg.webp)\n\n## Top Developers in Mumbai\n\n## Builders\n\nNo builders found\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Where is Dimples Westwood located?\n\n### What is the available Apartment size in Dimples Westwood?\n\n### What is the RERA Number of Dimples Westwood of Kandivali West?\n\n### What is the price range of Dimples Westwood of Kandivali West?\n\n### Where to download the Dimples Westwood brochure?\n\n### Where to download the Dimples Westwood floor plan?\n\n### What is the nearest landmark to Dimples Westwood residential project?\n\n### What amenities are available at Dimples Westwood residential project?\n\n### Does Dimples Westwood residential project have covered car parking?\n\n### Which banks can approve loans for Dimples Westwood residential project?\n\n### Is a transportation facility easily available near Dimples Westwood residential project?\n\n![chat](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/Common/chatLightBg.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\n## About the Builder\n\n![Dimples Group Logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9fb08386bae1540186bb70abfb6b12/logo/8a9fb08386bae1540186bb70abfb6b12_logo_YKOzxCIlGi1752673635013.jpg)\n\n### Dimples Group\n\nA symbol of trust and quality in the building and construction industry, Dimple’s Group, laid its founding stone in the year 1998. Since then, it has mastered reputed lifestyle projects across Mumbai's landscape, adding more glamour to the city’s skyline.\nDimple’s Group has earned a lot of goodwill amongst its existing customers. Our benevolence has been earned by strong work ethics which is an integral aspect of the company’s core values.\nHaving developed over 12 lakh sqft, we have completed about 20 plus projects providing supreme quality homes and excellent services to over 5000 customers. Meticulous planning, timely completion and architectural innovation across diverse projects add to our repute.\nWe’ve happily handed over projects in Andheri, Kandivali, Borivali, Dahisar and Mira Road. All of these projects are an epitome of luxury and value. Ethics are an integral aspect of the company's core values. We are renowned for our build quality and timely delivery.\nHaving a well-established base with constructions scaling new heights our goal is to conquer the skyline of the city. Dimple’s Group is ever evolving towards the future aiming to provide our customers sheer delight along with a one of a kind living experience.\n\n## Dimples Westwood - Neighbourhood\n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Kandivali West Area\n\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/caret-right-bold.svg)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/dimple-westwood-kandivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333838343439","title":"Dimple Westwood in Kandivali West, Mumbai: Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Reviews","raw_content":"![image of Dimple Westwood](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2024/03/13/Project-Photo-1-Dimple-Westwood-Mumbai-5388449_345_1366_470_1080.jpg \"image of Dimple Westwood\")\n![image of Dimple Westwood](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2024/12/24/Project-Photo-7-Dimple-Westwood-Mumbai-5388449_485_838_470_1080.jpg \"image of Dimple Westwood\")\n![image of Dimple Westwood](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2024/12/24/Project-Photo-6-Dimple-Westwood-Mumbai-5388449_263_259_470_1080.jpg \"image of Dimple Westwood\")\n![image of Dimple Westwood](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2024/12/24/Project-Photo-5-Dimple-Westwood-Mumbai-5388449_438_430_470_1080.jpg \"image of Dimple Westwood\")\n![image of Dimple Westwood](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2024/12/24/Project-Photo-4-Dimple-Westwood-Mumbai-5388449_513_473_470_1080.jpg \"image of Dimple Westwood\")\n\n# Dimple Westwood Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## By Dimples Group\n\n## Dimple Westwood Floor Plans & Pricing\n\n![Dimple Westwood 2 BHK 643 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 2 BHK 643 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"image\")\n\n## Properties in Dimple Westwood\n\n![Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 604 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 604 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 620 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 620 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 414 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 414 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 418 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 418 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 447 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 447 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 612 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 612 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 418 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dimple Westwood 1 BHK Flat 418 sq.ft\")\n![Dimple Westwood 2 BHK Flat 604 sq.ft](data